[gd_scene format=3]

; The mechanics lab: not part of the game. A plain room where the headless checks (GripCheck, CombatCheck,
; HarpoonCheck) drive the player through the mechanics with the real input actions: a metal wall rising into a
; metal ceiling slab, a floating metal block to hang under and wrap around, two harpoon anchors under the slab,
; a shrine, a relic (Drill, so the grip check's Mag-grip stays its own) and a Votary praying toward the west wall.

